{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117061807576-1117_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261117065008\"/><p>美國聯合航空公司周一（16日）出現大型系統故障，起飛航班受影響，公司於社交網站表示正啟動後備方案並爭取盡快回復正常運作。</p><p>美國聯邦航空局已知悉事件。聯合航空表示正飛行的航班或涉及子公司聯合捷運（United Express）的航班不受影響。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:04:49.708043+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T22:18:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:15:06.462512+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T22:58:17.224970+00:00","content_hash":"c852e40004c364505a2fe9a96fe9f86bb282e8931884c3cbf5d3155d87f5e097","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}